    "content": {
        "$comment": "Business-content contract seed, merged over repobot.content.json at compose (the care pack's discipline). The appointments domain mirrors content.ts codeAppointments entry for entry (the pack's content tests pin the twin), so the Manage visit calendar opens on exactly the visits the site already offers, and the platform projects exactly the capacity-1 slots the sandbox simulation shows on the inquiry page. The seed is booking mode 2's input: the platform generates a booking_session per provider x window x visit type occurrence, capacity 1, with the provider-wide overlap lock making double-booking impossible. Durations are minutes; windows are weekday index (0 = Sunday) x minutes since midnight — one provider, because the founder does every walkthrough.",
        "appointments": {
            "types": [
                {
                    "typeId": "urgent-service-call",
                    "name": "Urgent service call",
                    "durationMinutes": 90,
                    "description": "The first opening for a problem that can't wait long — but isn't a right-now emergency."
                },
                {
                    "typeId": "inspection",
                    "name": "Whole-home inspection",
                    "durationMinutes": 60,
                    "description": "A scheduled top-to-bottom look at the system — what's fine, what's aging, what's next."
                }
